                    {
                        "form_id": "f4ef7448-019f-48a4-97c3-3f64e96a6a65",
                        "entry_id": "e50ae1ea-c64b-33f6-9a38-e858cad7eabe",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "схи́зме"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "987ec6f5-92e7-4fb1-b561-d9f89b8239db",
                        "entry_id": "e50ae1ea-c64b-33f6-9a38-e858cad7eabe",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "схи́змах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6f3c1e08-5e0c-3872-b314-21829e246bfb",
                        "entry_id": "e50ae1ea-c64b-33f6-9a38-e858cad7eabe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "церк. раскол, отделение от ранее единой церкви какой-либо её части"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "84f38084-684e-4cd4-9da9-f33849d79866",
                                "sense_id": "6f3c1e08-5e0c-3872-b314-21829e246bfb",
                                "text": "Мне кажется, что здесь, несмотря на схизму, народ так же, как и в православной России, не очень набожен."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3cbbc343-7048-4b24-b324-c6379bea3873",
                                "sense_id": "6f3c1e08-5e0c-3872-b314-21829e246bfb",
                                "text": "Потом началась великая схизма, давшая новые средства светской власти против духовной."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8a34280-387e-4d21-b6aa-1012060e9587",
                                "sense_id": "6f3c1e08-5e0c-3872-b314-21829e246bfb",
                                "text": "Он стремится показать или обнажить сам корень схизмы, показать эту основную отделяющую силу."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7b0d30d6-77bf-3adb-b25e-4956224347ff",
                        "entry_id": "e50ae1ea-c64b-33f6-9a38-e858cad7eabe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "муз. микроинтервал, примерно равный двум центам, определяемый как разница между пифагорейской и синтонической коммами, близкая по величине разнице между натуральной и равномерно темперированной чистыми квинтами"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d74f46df-9807-470a-b9cd-b47ab7109e06",
                                "sense_id": "7b0d30d6-77bf-3adb-b25e-4956224347ff",
                                "text": "Разница между ПК (пифагорейской коммой) и СК (синтонической коммой) есть схизма… Схизматическая квинта даёт примерно одно биение а середине клавиатуры и эквивалентна нашей современной темперированной квинте, что лишь случайное совпадение."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "77ea6752-8201-4072-a1a2-a14c8f63ac44",
                        "source_entry_id": "e50ae1ea-c64b-33f6-9a38-e858cad7eabe",
                        "source_sense_description": "церковный раскол",
                        "target_lang_word": "schism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "schism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d2ccc8a-d7b5-35c7-830a-c8cc5ad56396",
                                        "entry_id": "fc178c07-4c3f-330f-ab71-59407a884ff3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A split or separation within a group or organization, typically caused by discord."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5e27c7c-485e-4b46-9d6a-7523390e08d8",
                                                "sense_id": "6d2ccc8a-d7b5-35c7-830a-c8cc5ad56396",
                                                "text": "Despite personal schisms and differences in spiritual experience, there is a very coherent theology of Snape shared between the wives. To examine this manifestation of religious fandom, I will first discuss the canon scepticism and anti-Rowling sentiment that helps to contextualise the wider belief in Snape as a character who extends beyond book and film."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d60733a-b691-45a5-8028-66e195cedc96",
                                                "sense_id": "6d2ccc8a-d7b5-35c7-830a-c8cc5ad56396",
                                                "text": "But Harry, in his civilian suit, was also a reminder of the schism between the traditional and the modern in the royal family that can’t be drowned out by pageantry."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f247e58f-8858-3bb3-94ad-90e55d1fe574",
                                        "entry_id": "fc178c07-4c3f-330f-ab71-59407a884ff3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A formal division or split within a religious body."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08b13dc4-fd4a-40da-85cf-c1de1719549a",
                                                "sense_id": "f247e58f-8858-3bb3-94ad-90e55d1fe574",
                                                "text": "The schism between Sunnis and Shias happened quite early in Islamic history."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d97cc5ed-825d-3722-961c-d6e72ec792d2",
                                        "entry_id": "fc178c07-4c3f-330f-ab71-59407a884ff3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "a split within Christianity whereby a group no longer recognizes the Bishop of Rome as the head of the Church, but shares essentially the same beliefs with the Church of Rome. In other words, a political split without the introduction of heresy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "schism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1143a15-1620-3b37-a8a5-45497071ef44",
                                        "entry_id": "3790dfef-4716-37e8-b979-79f7912c9b7a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To split, divide (a group or organization)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "993d3436-67a0-40c1-9e45-caa511bd6080",
                                                "sense_id": "d1143a15-1620-3b37-a8a5-45497071ef44",
                                                "text": "“This is going to schism Maga terribly online,” Kirk said. “You're going to see—I don't want to say a Maga civil war, but it's going to be a Maga online food fight that is going to be very hard to navigate.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "131874d0-80f1-4cda-bd45-5299bf207f2e",
                        "source_entry_id": "e50ae1ea-c64b-33f6-9a38-e858cad7eabe",
                        "source_sense_description": "церковный раскол",
                        "target_lang_word": "Schisma",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Schisma",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c5dd3dc6-7e90-3abc-a806-1403245f9db6",
                                        "entry_id": "57fb8f78-4c4c-34a8-83e7-cd584c82773b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Spaltung von Religionsgemeinschaften"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32d921a2-e340-4c19-a25a-a99055a1cbd4",
                                                "sense_id": "c5dd3dc6-7e90-3abc-a806-1403245f9db6",
                                                "text": "Das so genannte große Schisma ist der Zerfall der katholischen Kirche in die römisch-katholische und die orthodoxen Kirchen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40893372-a27e-433a-97e9-5d39ffb71b5a",
                                                "sense_id": "c5dd3dc6-7e90-3abc-a806-1403245f9db6",
                                                "text": "Schismen gibt es nicht nur im Christentum, sondern auch in anderen Religionen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a659c9d-cde6-4257-bec8-dd621d267f64",
                                                "sense_id": "c5dd3dc6-7e90-3abc-a806-1403245f9db6",
                                                "text": "„Häresie nennt man die nach Empfang der Taufe erfolgte beharrliche Leugnung einer kraft göttlichen und katholischen Glaubens zu glaubenden Wahrheit oder einen beharrlichen Zweifel an einer solchen Glaubenswahrheit; Apostasie nennt man die Ablehnung des christlichen Glaubens im ganzen; Schisma nennt man die Verweigerung der Unterordnung unter den Papst oder der Gemeinschaft mit den diesem untergebenen Gliedern der Kirche.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "367091f3-dabb-3587-a238-4eefed4c17d3",
                                        "entry_id": "57fb8f78-4c4c-34a8-83e7-cd584c82773b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Spaltung einer Gruppe aufgrund eines ideologischen Streits"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figurative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5d7c1bc-9a3d-40e9-8e71-deb692225e1a",
                                                "sense_id": "367091f3-dabb-3587-a238-4eefed4c17d3",
                                                "text": "Das Zerwürfnis zwischen der Sowjetunion und der Volksrepublik China wird auch als kommunistisches Schisma bezeichnet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a69d150-07d0-4a14-9142-21e0924b16a2",
                                                "sense_id": "367091f3-dabb-3587-a238-4eefed4c17d3",
                                                "text": "„Daß Lämmerts bevorstehende Emeritierung nun mit der Aufhebung des literarischen und geisteswissenschaftlichen Schismas zusammenfällt, ist ein lebensgeschichtlicher Zufall, allerdings ein vielsagender.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fa2783cb-4728-4924-94a4-13ddcec8cf20",
                        "source_entry_id": "e50ae1ea-c64b-33f6-9a38-e858cad7eabe",
